{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2021-10-25 09:45:00', 'title': 'COMCAST DONATES $25,000 TO CODEVA AND 500 LAPTOPS TO RICHMOND PUBLIC SCHOOLS STUDENTS TO MARK THE 10TH ANNIVERSARY OF INTERNET ESSENTIALS', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA., OCT. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COMCAST TODAY ANNOUNCED A $25,000 GRANT TO SUPPORT CODEVA AND\xa0ITS\xa0FREE COMPUTER SCIENCE PROGRAMS FOR CITY STUDENTS AND TEACHERS,\xa0ALONG WITH A DONATION OF 500 FREE LAPTOPS, WHICH WILL BE DISTRIBUTED TO RICHMOND PUBLIC SCHOOLS STUDENTS AND RESIDENT SENIORS ACROSS THE CITY.'}